{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13106030.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13106030","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13106030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1310603001:0":{"text":"집안이 왜 또 이렇게 엉망인 거죠? 제전은 이미 끝난 거 아닌가요?","source_cn":"怎么屋子又是一片狼藉？祭典不是结束了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9B9B98A7EAE80D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1310603002:0":{"text":"어라? 로잔, 뭐하고 계세요?","source_cn":"咦？洛桑这是在干什么啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4236B873E9F2E90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13106040.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13106040","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13106040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1310604001:0":{"text":"로잔, 또 “시체”로 변장해서 사람을 놀라게 하려는 건가요? 흥, 이번엔 더 이상 무서워하지 않을 거예요!","source_cn":"洛桑，你又想装“尸体”吓唬人吗？哼，满满这次可不会再害怕了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F5371A7B69105D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310604002:0":{"text":"어라, 들키다니! 휴... 보너스를 받긴 어렵겠네요...","source_cn":"哎呀，被你识破了！看来没办法让老板娘给我奖励了，真可惜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D8F2477934E8E4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310604003:1":{"text":"하지만... 제전은 이미 끝났는데... 게르다 부인이 보너스를 줄까요?","source_cn":"可是……祭典不是已经结束了吗？格尔达女士还会给你奖励？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF23C4F155B52162C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310604004:0":{"text":"...와, 그 말이야말로 제일 무서운 말이네요! 치피, 이렇게 사람을 무섭게 하는 재주도 있군요!","source_cn":"……哇，你这句话才是最吓人的！满满，没想到你的恐怖天赋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA494CD06FACCCA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310604005:1":{"text":"네? 로잔? 그게 무슨 말이에요? 저희랑 같이 시더 마을로 가서 마차를 구하겠다고 하지 않으셨어요?","source_cn":"啊？洛桑，你在说什么？你不是要陪我们去雪松镇找驿车吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB500A62E4EA1BEB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310604006:0":{"text":"마차요? 떠나려고요? 제전 기간엔 손님이 너무 많아서 마차를 구하기가 어렵다고 하던데... 제전에 참석한 뒤에 떠나는 건 어떤가요?","source_cn":"找驿车？你们要离开了？听说祭典期间因为客人太多，很难雇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA1E8172BE7FF7C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310604007:1":{"text":"...호 ...혹시 일부러 모르는 척하는 거예요, 로잔?","source_cn":"……你……你是在装傻吗，洛桑？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF36E17B1EC828928","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310604008:0":{"text":"손님, 신경 쓰지 마세요. 이건 “고스트 하우스”를 위해 특별히 생각해낸 미니 게임으로 분위기를 띄우기 위한 거예요.","source_cn":"亲爱的客人，不要介意哦，这是我们为了“鬼影密室”特意设...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31C1D035B83C7135","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1310604009:1":{"text":"제전은 말이에요, 무언가 자극이 있어야 재미있죠, 그렇지 않나요? 여러분은 “고스트 하우스”에 참가하러 온 분들이시죠?","source_cn":"祭典嘛，总是需要一些刺激才有意思，不是吗？亲爱的客人，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60C7815BF20CF4E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1310604010:0":{"text":"아 참, 제 소개가 늦었네요. 전 이곳의 사장 게르다입니다. 다들 절 따라오세요. 이다음부터가 진짜랍니다!","source_cn":"忘了自我介绍，我是这里的老板娘格尔达。大家随我来吧，接...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC2BB3B9AA10A13E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1310604011:0":{"text":"게르다 님, 음, 저희... 아는 사이 아니었나요...?","source_cn":"格尔达女士，呃，你……不认识我们了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA872C618E1B43CF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1310604012:0":{"text":"다른 사람은 잊어도 해미 씨는... 하하, 전 이곳에서 여러분 외에 다른 햄스터 서머너를 본 적이 없어요.","source_cn":"亲爱的，别的人或许我会忘记，但你……哈哈，除了你们，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB644FD943492DC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1310604013:0":{"text":"하지만... 제전은 이미 끝난 것 아닌가요? 어젯밤에 당신과 로잔은 여관을 정리하느라 점화 의식에도 참석하지 못했던 걸로 기억하는데...","source_cn":"但是……祭典不是已经结束了？我记得昨天晚上你和洛桑为了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x537E5FC841E363B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1310604014:0":{"text":"해미, 제전이 끝나다니 무슨 소리예요, 알겠으니까 장난 그만 치세요, 이제 정말 무서워지려고 해요. 하하하.","source_cn":"弥萨忒在上，漫漫，快告诉我，你们想了多久才想出这一套说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4936412117C5111C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1310604015:0":{"text":"확실히 무섭긴 하네요. 하하하, 로잔, 좀 더 빨리 그들을 소개해 주지 그랬어요. 만약 그들을 고용했다면 올해 “고스트 하우스”는 더 무섭고, 더 짜릿했을 거라구요!","source_cn":"的确很恐怖。哈哈哈，洛桑，你该早点把他们介绍给我认识。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x176227D4DE0E47BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1310604016:0":{"text":"마스터, 이게... 다들 어떻게 된 거죠?","source_cn":"主人，这……他们都怎么了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEA991267AB5510DA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 이게... 다들 어떻게 된 거죠?","female":"마스터, 이게... 다들 어떻게 된 거죠?","variant_male_record_index":"142443","variant_female_record_index":"142444","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:28:1310604016":{"text":"마스터, 이게... 다들 어떻게 된 거죠?","source_cn":"主人，这……他们都怎么了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEA991267AB5510DA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 이게... 다들 어떻게 된 거죠?","female":"마스터, 이게... 다들 어떻게 된 거죠?","variant_male_record_index":"142443","variant_female_record_index":"142444","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1310604017:0":{"text":"이상하네요. 어제까지만 해도 다들 괜찮지 않았나요?","source_cn":"好奇怪啊，昨天大家不都还是好好的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x824B9506246B9614","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1310604018:0":{"text":"우리는 오늘도 괜찮은걸요! 하지만 저들은 조금도 괜찮지 않아 보여요... 뭔가 시간이 되돌아간 듯한 느낌이네요!","source_cn":"不对，我们今天也是好好的！但他们一点也不好……他们好像...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D2B5362526B27C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1310604023:0":{"text":"전혀 갈피가 안 잡히는데요... 마스터, 무언가 이상한 점은 없는지 “고스트 하우스”에 한 번 가볼까요?","source_cn":"一点头绪都没有啊……主人，不如我们就顺势去看看“鬼影密...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x87717D26E3BD3E4F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"전혀 갈피가 안 잡히는데요... 마스터, 무언가 이상한 점은 없는지 “고스트 하우스”에 한 번 가볼까요?","female":"전혀 갈피가 안 잡히는데요... 마스터, 무언가 이상한 점은 없는지 “고스트 하우스”에 한 번 가볼까요?","variant_male_record_index":"142451","variant_female_record_index":"142452","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1310604024:0":{"text":"치피의 생각에 동의해요! 조용히 가서 살펴볼 수 있을 거예요. 지난번 밀실에 진짜 살아있는 시체가 나타났었잖아요...","source_cn":"我同意满满的想法！我们可以悄悄地探查，我记得，上次在密...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B35EE7DC457BC55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1310604025:0":{"text":"맞아요, 그 사람은 마르고 키가 큰 데다 칼 두 자루를 들고 다니고 늘 구부정한 자세로 있는 살아있는 시체에요. 그에게 악의가 없다는 건 알고 있지만, 어쨌거나 하나의 조사 방향이 될 수는 있잖아요.","source_cn":"对，那个又瘦又高，拿着两把刀，总是佝偻着身体的活死人。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5580DE44757AD86A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1310604026:0":{"text":"오늘 한 번 제대로 조사해 봐요! 어쩌면 이곳의 이상한 상황이 살아있는 시체와 연관이 있을지도 몰라요!","source_cn":"嗯，今天我们可以好好检查一番，说不定这里的怪异情况和活...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF30C554619DF60F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:0:1":{"text":"제전이 아직 끝나지 않았다고 생각하는 건가?","source_cn":"他们认为祭典还没结束？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x601B8ACBB30A1E27","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"제전이 아직 끝나지 않았다고 생각하는 건가?","female":"제전이 아직 끝나지 않았다고 생각하는 건가?","variant_male_record_index":"68092","variant_female_record_index":"68093","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1310604019:0":{"text":"네? 어떻게 하룻밤 사이에 전에 있었던 일을 잊어버릴 수가 있죠... 이건 너무 마법 같은걸요!","source_cn":"啊，怎么会一夜之间就忘掉之前的事情呢……这太魔法了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0988A4275A17CD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1310604020:0":{"text":"이상하네요, 그들은 제전이 끝났다는 것 외에 다른 일은 전부 기억하고 있어요.","source_cn":"奇怪，看起来他们只是忘了祭典已经结束，其他的事情都没有忘记。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C3C45F31E38AAFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:1:2":{"text":"전에 있던 일을 잊어버린 건가?","source_cn":"他们遗忘了之前的事？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAC0B12B954E6EE62","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"전에 있던 일을 잊어버린 건가?","female":"전에 있던 일을 잊어버린 건가?","variant_male_record_index":"68094","variant_female_record_index":"68095","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1310604021:0":{"text":"하지만 이런 장난의 대가는 너무 큰데요. 이 두 사람은 어제 겨우겨우 여관을 정리했는데...","source_cn":"但这样恶作剧的代价也太大了，他们昨天可是好不容易才把旅...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F80EF16292BF922","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1310604022:0":{"text":"게다가 조금 전, 로잔의 표정... 진짜 같았어요.","source_cn":"而且，刚才洛桑的表情很真实，根本就不像是恶作剧被拆穿的样子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34AFCC144BD41B76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:2:3":{"text":"장난을 치는 건가?","source_cn":"他们在恶作剧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1AF8FB59ADF84916","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"장난을 치는 건가?","female":"장난을 치는 건가?","variant_male_record_index":"68096","variant_female_record_index":"68097","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格尔达":{"text":"게르다","source":"格尔达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":31,"localized_text_count":30,"speaker_count":4}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13106050.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13106050","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13106050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1310605001:0":{"text":"“고스트 하우스” 종목에 참가하는 분들은 이쪽으로 오세요.","source_cn":"参加“鬼影密室”项目的朋友们，请走这里呦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FD20B455CE1C4A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310605002:1":{"text":"알아요, 지하실에서 진행되는 거죠!","source_cn":"我们知道，是在地下室举办的，对吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B6CE3085D01E8DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310605003:1":{"text":"...맞아요. 자, 이건 “게임 설명서”에요. 별다른 문제가 없다면, 입장해서 준비해 주세요.","source_cn":"……没错，亲爱的。喏，这是“游戏规则书”，如果没有问题...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x609369BA2C7C26A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310605004:1":{"text":"가장 처음 밀실에서 나온 사람이 승자가 되고, 승자는 꽃잎 하나를 얻게 돼요!","source_cn":"第一位走出密室的朋友就是赢家，能得到一枚花瓣！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25FF1E63876DBBEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格尔达":{"text":"게르다","source":"格尔达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13106060.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13106060","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13106060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1310606001:0":{"text":"그 여행자의 일기는 아직 남아있지만 아무도 말을 하거나, 문을 두드리는 사람은 없어요.","source_cn":"那本旅人日记还在，可是没有人说话和敲门了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6220EBE4AF2A6E33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1310606002:0":{"text":"이 문도 갑자기 닫히지 않았구욥...","source_cn":"这扇门也没有突然关上……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC59E8D55A3738934","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13106070.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13106070","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13106070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:5:1310607001:1":{"text":"어라, 이번엔 지난번과 완전히 달라요...","source_cn":"咦，这次跟上次完全不一样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43ED2149FB12E892","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310607002:1":{"text":"모든 문은 열려있는데다, 수수께끼를 풀 필요도 없는 것 같아요.","source_cn":"所有的门都是开着的，似乎也不需要去完成那些谜题了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23F514A33B19DFCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1310607002":{"text":"모든 문은 열려있는데다, 수수께끼를 풀 필요도 없는 것 같아요.","source_cn":"所有的门都是开着的，似乎也不需要去完成那些谜题了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23F514A33B19DFCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310607003:1":{"text":"정말 시시하네요... 설마 정말 장난을 치다가 밀실을 원래대로 되돌려 놓는 걸 잊으신 걸까요?","source_cn":"真没意思……难道真的是老板娘他们在恶作剧，但是忘了把密...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF39AE2334699AB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310607004:1":{"text":"음, 살아있는 시체로 변장한 직원도 없고, 진짜 살아있는 시체도 나타나지 않았어요...","source_cn":"唔，没有员工来假扮成活死人，那个真正的活死人也没有出现……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AADAA80A0AB3F1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310607005:1":{"text":"너무 이상해요. 계속해서 상황을 살펴봐요.","source_cn":"太奇怪了，我们再继续看看情况吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9887F7BCBB36C3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"너무 성의 없는 거 아니야?","source_cn":"这也太敷衍了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4C750317F76E6162","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"너무 성의 없는 거 아니야?","female":"너무 성의 없는 거 아니야?","variant_male_record_index":"68098","variant_female_record_index":"68099","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"만들다 만 것 같은 느낌인데","source_cn":"怎么像是个半成品","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x80E8348C2119315A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"만들다 만 것 같은 느낌인데","female":"만들다 만 것 같은 느낌인데","variant_male_record_index":"68100","variant_female_record_index":"68101","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13106080.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13106080","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13106080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1310608001:0":{"text":"그 가짜 대문도 보이지 않아요...","source_cn":"假的大门也不见了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5E74E5FFC4C328A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1310608002:0":{"text":"복도에 있는 유화 쪽에 가서 찾아보면 문을 열 수 있는 열쇠를 찾을 수 있을지도 모르겠어요!","source_cn":"这样看来，说不定直接去走廊的油画那里找找，就能拿到开门...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F3A08AC6E33A64E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13106090.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13106090","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13106090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1310609001:0":{"text":"정말... 정말 열쇠를 손에 넣었어요!","source_cn":"真的……真的拿到开门钥匙了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90A00D37D54770E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1310609002:0":{"text":"이렇게 간단하게 끝나는 건가?","source_cn":"这么简单就结束了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x649B7420CF96C78E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310609003:0":{"text":"이번엔 아무도 만나지 못했어...","source_cn":"这次什么人都没有遇见……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC1EDAC9214B47132","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이번엔 아무도 만나지 못했어...","female":"이번엔 아무도 만나지 못했어...","variant_male_record_index":"142471","variant_female_record_index":"142472","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:主角":{"text":"주인공","source":"主角","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13106100.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13106100","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13106100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1310610001:1":{"text":"마스터, 이번 “고스트 하우스”는 너무 쉬운 것 같아요! 마치... 마치...","source_cn":"主人，我感觉这次的“鬼影密室”好简单啊！就像是……像是……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x40D7578747F80C4C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 이번 “고스트 하우스”는 너무 쉬운 것 같아요! 마치... 마치...","female":"마스터, 이번 “고스트 하우스”는 너무 쉬운 것 같아요! 마치... 마치...","variant_male_record_index":"142473","variant_female_record_index":"142474","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310610002:1":{"text":"미완성품 같아요!","source_cn":"像是未完成品！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11CD6A47ABB7832F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310610003:1":{"text":"맞아요! 게다가 저흰 그 살아있는 시체도, 그와 연관된 단서도 보지 못했어요...","source_cn":"没错！而且我们既没有见到那个活死人，也没有找到任何和他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EDF28FC04603395","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310610004:1":{"text":"축하해요. 여러분이 가장 먼저 출구를 찾고 밀실에서 탈출한 참가자랍니다. 규칙대로... 어머, 벌써 꽃잎을 가지고 있군요? 제가 언제 드렸죠? 왜 기억이 안 날까요.","source_cn":"恭喜，你们是最先找到出口、离开密室的参与者。按照规则，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD516021188A6B1A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310610005:1":{"text":"이렇게 하죠. 우선 조금 전 고스트 하우스에서 어떤 “살아있는 시체”가 가장 훌륭하고 리얼했는지 얘기해 주실래요? 그들에게 보상을 제대로 해야겠어요... 음, 한 달, 아니, 세 달 치 보너스를 줄 거예요!","source_cn":"这样吧，先说说你们觉得哪些“活死人”的表现最精彩、最逼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB58522E35C762E3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310610006:0":{"text":"세 달 치 보너스! 그럴 줄 알았으면 고스트 하우스로 가서 “살아있는 시체” 역할을 하는 건데...","source_cn":"三个月奖金！早知道，我就该去鬼影密室里扮演“活死人”才...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC5D106087E1FC7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1310610006":{"text":"세 달 치 보너스! 그럴 줄 알았으면 고스트 하우스로 가서 “살아있는 시체” 역할을 하는 건데...","source_cn":"三个月奖金！早知道，我就该去鬼影密室里扮演“活死人”才对……<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC5D106087E1FC7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310610007:0":{"text":"휴, 그들의 연기가 아직 부족한가 봐요. 안되겠네요, 제대로 된 수업을 해줘야겠어요!","source_cn":"唉，看来他们的演技还不够好，不行不行，得给他们好好上上课！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD94DD572874BFE0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1310610012:0":{"text":"크흠, 어쨌거나, 여러분이 1등이에요! 일단 꽃잎을 어디에 뒀는지 찾아볼게요. 잃어버려서는 안 되는데...","source_cn":"咳，总之，你们是第一名！等我好好找找花瓣放到哪里去了，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCED139B536AE7F7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1310610013:0":{"text":"게르다 씨가 한 말도 지난번이랑 비슷한 걸 보니, 연기는 아닌 것 같아요...","source_cn":"格尔达女士就连说的话都和上次差不多，这个样子不像是演的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AE62F311D9A22CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1310610014:0":{"text":"너무 이상한데요... 제가 꿈을 꾸고 있는 건 아닌지 의심스러워요...","source_cn":"太奇怪了，我都要怀疑是我在做梦了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8291582DE6E1716C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"리얼한 사람은 없었어, 다 별로 안 무서웠어","source_cn":"没有很逼真的，都不可怕","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA5C9B484394345F2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"리얼한 사람은 없었어, 다 별로 안 무서웠어","female":"리얼한 사람은 없었어, 다 별로 안 무서웠어","variant_male_record_index":"68102","variant_female_record_index":"68103","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1310610008:0":{"text":"네? 모두에게 세 달 치 보너스를 줘야 한다면... 그건...","source_cn":"啊？难道每个人都要多发三个月奖金……这……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAA35C98E1A8BA62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"모두 다 무서웠어!","source_cn":"所有人都很可怕！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCF86687BBA23484B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"모두 다 무서웠어!","female":"모두 다 무서웠어!","variant_male_record_index":"68104","variant_female_record_index":"68105","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1310610009:1":{"text":"문제요? 밀실이 짜릿하지 않았나요?","source_cn":"有什么问题？难道你们觉得密室还不够刺激？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECF3F85BFF31B42C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1310610010:0":{"text":"게르다 씨, 제전이 끝났다는 걸 정말 모르시는 건가요? 마스터가 직접 얼음조각에 불멸의 불을 붙였다고요! 거짓말 아니에요!","source_cn":"格尔达女士，你真的不知道祭典已经结束了吗？主人亲手为冰...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0316EA930C26523C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"게르다 씨, 제전이 끝났다는 걸 정말 모르시는 건가요? 마스터가 직접 얼음조각에 불멸의 불을 붙였다고요! 거짓말 아니에요!","female":"게르다 씨, 제전이 끝났다는 걸 정말 모르시는 건가요? 마스터가 직접 얼음조각에 불멸의 불을 붙였다고요! 거짓말 아니에요!","variant_male_record_index":"142483","variant_female_record_index":"142484","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1310610011:0":{"text":"여러분은 확실히 사람을 놀라게 하는 뛰어난 고수시군요. 만약 제가 선별할 수 있다면 “선택받은 자”는 여러분이 될 거예요!","source_cn":"……亲爱的，你们的确是出色的吓人高手。要是让我来遴选，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0080FA0A01D914FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:2:3":{"text":"무언가 문제가 있는 것 같지 않아?","source_cn":"你不觉得有问题吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA6C7963BD1442061","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"무언가 문제가 있는 것 같지 않아?","female":"무언가 문제가 있는 것 같지 않아?","variant_male_record_index":"68106","variant_female_record_index":"68107","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格尔达":{"text":"게르다","source":"格尔达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":4}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13106110.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13106110","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13106110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1310611001:0":{"text":"하하, 다들 안색이 창백한 걸 보니 고스트 하우스에 놀란 것 같네요.","source_cn":"哈哈，看你们的脸色有点苍白，一定是被鬼影密室给吓到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A220F8E5B93AF08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310611002:0":{"text":"올해의 밀실은 제가 계획한 거예요. 어때요, 대단하죠? 시더 마을에서 오랫동안 전해져 온 무서운 이야기에서 영감을 얻었답니다! ","source_cn":"今年的密室可是我策划的，怎么样，很厉害吧？是我从一个在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC78E791845569425","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310611003:0":{"text":"음... 이 말은 새롭네요. 지난번엔 듣지 못했어요.","source_cn":"呃……这句话倒是新的，上次没说过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48166184D0FCD6CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1310611003":{"text":"음... 이 말은 새롭네요. 지난번엔 듣지 못했어요.","source_cn":"呃……这句话倒是新的，上次没说过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48166184D0FCD6CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310611004:0":{"text":"오늘은 그레이브본이 나타나지 않아서 오지 않은 것 같아요. 저희의 대화를 끊지도 않았고요...","source_cn":"今天确实没有亡灵出现，所以他没有来，也就没有打断我们的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9BD3CD9DE661AED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310611005:0":{"text":"팔라모르? 음, 그 이름을 들어본 적이 있는 것 같은데...","source_cn":"法拉莫尔？呃，我应该听人提到过这个名字……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2485D55D3714388","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310611007:0":{"text":"다들 오늘 왜 그래요? 아침부터 이상한 소리를 하시고... 무슨 고민이라도 있나요? 제전은 고작 며칠뿐인데, 서둘러서 즐겨야죠!","source_cn":"你们今天怎么了？从大早上开始就在说些奇怪的话……有什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D735B5023665607","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310611008:1":{"text":"음... 아무것도 모르고 근심 걱정 없는 모습이 너무 부럽네요...","source_cn":"呃……真羡慕你什么都不知道，无忧无虑的样子啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94791F7B49DD0D12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310611009:0":{"text":"로잔, 계속 여기서 머무르실 건가요? 여행은 하지 않으시는 거예요?","source_cn":"洛桑，你还要留在这里吗？你不打算继续游历了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF2BB309CF7E6CA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310611010:0":{"text":"하, 이렇게 재미있는 제전이 있는데 어떻게 가겠어요! 제전에 참석하는 것도 하나의 여행이죠. 이건 숲의 제전과는 완전히 다른 느낌이거든요!","source_cn":"哈，这么有趣的祭典，我可不舍得走！参加祭典也是一种游历...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C221B64A5F286D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1310611011:0":{"text":"게다가 아름다운 게르다 부인과 이곳에서 반년 더 일하겠다고 약속했답니다.\n시더 마을의 다른 종목은 참가하지 않을 생각인가요?","source_cn":"而且，按照和美丽的格尔达女士的约定，我还得在这里工作半...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E912CF89A52D048","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1310611012:1":{"text":"가봐야죠. 그곳도 이곳처럼 또다시 제전이 시작된 건 아닌지 모르겠네요...","source_cn":"的确应该回去，不知道那里是不是和这边一样，又开始庆祝祭...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA68D53D90506C603","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1310611013:1":{"text":"마스터, 어서 시더 마을로 돌아가 봐요!","source_cn":"主人，我们回雪松镇去看看吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6867E824B982E416","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 어서 시더 마을로 돌아가 봐요!","female":"마스터, 어서 시더 마을로 돌아가 봐요!","variant_male_record_index":"142501","variant_female_record_index":"142502","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"이번엔 팔라모르가 오지 않았어","source_cn":"这次法拉莫尔没有来","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x546BF568B61D95E7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이번엔 팔라모르가 오지 않았어","female":"이번엔 팔라모르가 오지 않았어","variant_male_record_index":"68108","variant_female_record_index":"68109","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1310611006:0":{"text":"맞아요. 그 마르고 키가 큰 살아있는 시체도 나타나지 않았어요.","source_cn":"的确，那个又瘦又高的活死人也没有出现。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11C28E27E9F692EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"이번엔 살아있는 시체가 없었어","source_cn":"这次没有活死人","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x184CF9FC5B9D86E1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이번엔 살아있는 시체가 없었어","female":"이번엔 살아있는 시체가 없었어","variant_male_record_index":"68110","variant_female_record_index":"68111","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/timeline/timeline_story/1301010611.json":{"asset_key":"timeline/timeline_story_1301010611","episode":"timeline","category":"timeline_story","story_id":"1301010611","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":0,"speaker_count":0}}}}